OL,3,GNEWSAMan fled country after attacking
OL,4,Apolice in riot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football hooligan who fled the
OL,7,Fcountry after leading attacks on police
OL,8,Fduring one of the 2024 summer riots has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for almost three years.
OL,11,FJamie Latham was arrested at Newcastle
OL,12,FAirport after returning from Spain
OL,13,Falmost two years after his involvement
OL,14,Fin disorder in Middlesbrough, Teesside
OL,15,FCrown Court heard.
OL,17,FFootage showed him leading a charge and
OL,18,Frepeatedly kicking and throwing punches
OL,19,Fat officers during the violence, one of
OL,20,Fa number of national riots which
OL,21,Ferupted after the murders of three
OL,22,Fschoolgirls in Southport.
